(44, '54a46d5b25192b07c586360aa724c24e', 'assistant', 'To calculate the total expenses, we need to sum up all the expenses by category. \n\nTotal expenses = \nRent: ₹90,000.00 + \nSalary: ₹86,000.00 + \nRaw Materials - Wood Powder: ₹67,000.00 + \nMaintenance Spares: ₹40,200.00 + \nEmployee Welfare: ₹25,700.00 + \nRaw Materials - Corn Cob: ₹18,700.00 + \nRaw Materials - Cotton Stalk: ₹15,400.00 + \nRaw Materials - Nappier Grass: ₹9,800.00 + \nOffice Stationery: ₹3,450.00 + \nEquipment Purchase: ₹1,000.00\n\nTotal expenses = ₹90,000 + ₹86,000 + ₹67,000 + ₹40,200 + ₹25,700 + ₹18,700 + ₹15,400 + ₹9,800 + ₹3,450 + ₹1,000 \nTotal expenses = ₹357,250.00', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:48:40'),
