(48, '54a46d5b25192b07c586360aa724c24e', 'assistant', 'I understand that the total expenses of ₹357,250.00 may seem overwhelming. However, let\'s also consider your total revenue, which is ₹22,548.50. It\'s essential to review and manage your expenses to ensure the sustainability of your business. If you\'d like, I can help you explore ways to optimize your expenses or discuss potential strategies to increase revenue.', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:49:21'),
