(64, '3e9bcbc15dd29aeec5b807493a4b7867', 'assistant', 'According to the provided data, there are:\n\n- 17 orders that are \"delivered\" (₹4,499.00)\n- 8 orders that are \"confirmed\" (₹1,805.50)\n\nHowever, it\'s not explicitly stated that these orders are paid. \n\nBut, if we consider the \"delivered\", \"confirmed\", and \"shipped\" orders as paid, then:\n\n- delivered: 17 orders (₹4,499.00)\n- confirmed: 8 orders (₹1,805.50)\n- shipped: 2 orders (₹331.00)\n- out for delivery: 1 order (₹1,375.00)\n\nTotal paid and delivered (or in the process of delivery) orders: 17 + 8 + 2 + 1 = 28 orders \n\nTotal revenue from these orders: ₹4,499.00 + ₹1,805.50 + ₹331.00 + ₹1,375.00 = ₹8,010.50', NULL, '2026-04-28 09:30:04'),
