(66, 'aa6f218de6e7497cf88ca85b39c55520', 'assistant', 'The data provided shows the following order statuses and their corresponding total values:\n\n- pending: 68 orders (₹14,488.00)\n- delivered: 20 orders (₹7,574.00)\n- confirmed: 8 orders (₹1,805.50)\n- shipped: 2 orders (₹331.00)\n- out for delivery: 1 orders (₹1,375.00)\n\nTo determine the number of paid orders, we can assume that \'delivered\', \'confirmed\', \'shipped\', and \'out for delivery\' orders are paid. \n\nThe total number of paid orders would be: 20 (delivered) + 8 (confirmed) + 2 (shipped) + 1 (out for delivery) = 31 orders.', NULL, '2026-04-28 14:04:08'),
